    "### 3.4: Create the Agent, App and Runner"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "670aeb44",
   "metadata": {
    "papermill": {
     "duration": 0.011886,
     "end_time": "2025-11-17T00:50:32.705400",
