     "start_time": "2025-11-17T00:50:32.693514",
     "status": "completed"
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "**Step 1: Create the agent**\n",
    "\n",
    "Add the tool to the Agent. The tool decides internally when to request approval based on the order size."
